      "created_at": "2013-02-17T00:58:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi there :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>First off, let me say I love this game! I bought EE a few weeks ago, and after playing it a few times, immediately ordered IR and RC as well. It really is great!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, as I was sleeving my cards today, I noticed one of my RC cards was damaged; specifically, an Infection card from Plague Rat's villain deck. It looks like it might have stuck to another card during printing? The ink and some of the card on the card face have torn off.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What do I need to do to go about getting a replacement copy of this card?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks in advance!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cheers, Don.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:26.157Z",
